QL-MUZAG-AA     OpenVMS Alpha Cluster Traditional Departmental License
QL-MUZAQ-AA     OpenVMS Alpha Cluster Traditional Enterprise License

For detailed SCSI cluster configuration information, please refer to the
OpenVMS V6.2 New Features Manual (AA-QCM1A-RE), and the `'SCSI Clusters for
OpenVMS V6.2'' article in the June 1995 issue of Customer Update.




