EDCS II V2.4 Server for OpenVMS

EDCS II V2.4 software extends the current EDCS II OpenVMS VAX environment to
support OpenVMS Alpha systems using Oracle's Rdb database. EDCS II V2.4
Server for OpenVMS Alpha software is designed primarily for existing EDCS II
users who utilize EDCS II today using the EDCS command line or API
interface, and who wish to move to the OpenVMS Alpha platform.

EDCS II V2.4 software also provides updates for the EDCS II V2.2 Server for
OpenVMS VAX platform client, with support for Microsoft DOS, OpenVMS Alpha,
and OpenVMS VAX clients.

Both versions of EDCS II V2.4 extend the current EDCS II V2.2 environment
for building Windows applications by providing application access to EDCS
through a Windows DLL interface.

The supported clients for the OpenVMS Alpha systems include Microsoft
MS-DOS, OpenVMS Alpha, and OpenVMS VAX clients. Additionally EDCS II V2.4
supports the current layered products and operating systems used by the EDCS
II V2.2 software: OpenVMS V6.1, Oracle Rdb V6.0 for OpenVMS, and PATHWORKS
V5.0 software. The Forms interface and DECwindows interface are no longer
supported on EDCS II V2.4.

EDCS II V2.4 is available now. The product is distributed on CD-ROM, TK50,
and magtape media kits. Each kit contains the OpenVMS software for both VAX
and Alpha platforms, software for all respective clients, documentation, and
product release notes.

EDCS II V2.4 for OpenVMS VAX is a maintenance release. Users with current
Software Product Services contracts will receive the respective media and
documentation updates. EDCS II V2.4 for OpenVMS Alpha platforms is a new
product in this release. New service contracts will be required for the
Alpha platform.

