o  Remote diagnostics port, accessible through a simple serial link

Digital's clustering technology includes DECsafe Available Server for
Digital UNIX systems and full support for OpenVMS (DSSI) and SCSI clusters.
This software, coupled with the dependable AlphaServer system, provides high
availability, high performance, and linear expandability across the
computing environment.

Business critical applications can run unattended, as management features
provide early indications of potential system failures. The reliability
features, combined with simple management features, make the AlphaServer
1000 ideal for organizations with little or no MIS support. Remote diagnosis
capability allows administrators to further reduce support costs because
