DEClaser 3500P Printer

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Flexible print solution for Digital, PC, Mac, and UNIX system users

o  Fast 12 pages per minute print speed

o  High quality output of 600 dots per inch (dpi) resolution

o  Standard bidirectional interface, with optional interfaces also available

o  Optional fax interface enables sending and receiving of plain paper faxes

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The DEClaser 3500P printer provides high quality laser output for small
workgroups or small offices that need quick, reliable printing capabilities
that require little effort and maintenance. The DEClaser 3500P can be shared
in a homogeneous network environment; the standard bidirectional parallel
interface makes it easy.

With a print speed of 12 pages per minute, the DEClaser 3500P can easily
handle small workgroup or small office job flow. The printer's laser
technology offers true 600 dots per inch (dpi) resolution and resolution
enhancement that produces crisp, clean output -- which is essential for
producing both internal and external documents.

Application compatibility is preserved with Adobe automatic emulation
switching. This feature reliably handles PostScript Level 2 and HP-PCL 5
printer languages, creating seamless application compatibility and
reliability.

The DEClaser 3500P may be used as a multifunction device, which reduces
printing costs and saves on office space as well. The printer's
international fax interface allows faxes to be received and printed on plain
paper, thereby improving resolution.

BENEFITS

o  Duty cycle of 20,000 pages per month ensures robust, reliable printing.

o  Fast 12 pages per minute print speed handles print jobs quickly and
   easily for user workgroups of up to 10 people.

o  True 600 dots per inch resolution and resolution enhancement produce
   crisp, clean, and sharp text and graphics.

o  Auto-emulation sensing ensures application compatibility between
   PostScript Level 2 and HP-PCL 5 printer languages. End users can rely on
   their documents printing without changing the printer protocol.

o  Optional PostScript fax capabilities permit the sending and receiving of
   documents right from the desktop. Incoming faxes are printed on plain
   paper, improving resolution and readability.

o  Multiple paper handling options and capabilities provide the end user
   with a choice in job handling and document appearance.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

The DEClaser 3500P printer is available now through Digital and its
distributors and resellers. The DEClaser 3500P ships with a standard Digital
one year return-to-factory warranty. Flexible service agreements are also
available.

