All product variants exist in two models: a building-block kernel system and
an entry level packaged system with Windows NT factory installed. The new
Celebris XL and Alpha XL minimal kernel and entry level packaged Windows NT
systems can be ordered now and will begin shipping in September 1995
(October 1995 for the Celebris XL 133DP model).

All variants support Windows NT 3.51 (or later only). The operating system
is factory-installed on the entry level package systems or when a full
configuration (inclusive of CD-ROM, hard disk, and video) is ordered using
the building block model. In all cases, Windows NT media and documentation
are shipped with all factory installed models.

Building block kernel base systems

