drive, and a U.S. Country Kit containing keyboard, power cord, three button
mouse, and user guide. For the Celebris XL, a Windows NT operating system
kit and CD-ROM drive must be ordered separately. For the Alpha XL, a Windows
NT operating system kit is bundled in the U.S. Country Kit; a CD-ROM drive
is included in the kernel.

All options ordered with kernel systems will be factory installed unless
specified as spares. All systems shipped from manufacturing are set to 120
volts, and may be reset by the user as required.

