The Celebris XL entry packaged system contains 16 MB of memory. The Alpha XL
entry packaged system contains 32 MB of memory. Multimedia, sound,
networking, and communication adapters are selected from the options menu.
All options ordered with packaged systems will be factory installed unless
specified as spares. Systems can be set to 120 or 240 volts. All U.S.
systems shipped from manufacturing are set to 120 volts, and all worldwide
